  "_comment": "Payloads a TradeForce EA may send, and whether each must be accepted. src/lib/ea-contract.test.ts runs them through the website's zod schemas and infra/pool-agent/test_tf_bridge.py through the pool agent's validators: the two ingestion paths (HTTP for desktop EAs, file bridge for hosted ones) must agree on every case. `expect` lists normalised output fields where the schema transforms the input.",
